cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FluxMMM in research or industry work, please cite the software and working paper."
title: "FluxMMM and RegretSet-MMM: Evidence-Adaptive, Decision-Focused Selection of Bayesian Marketing Mix Models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bramao
    given-names: Gustavo
version: 4.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-06
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gustavobramao/fluxmmm"
url: "https://fluxmmm-web.web.app/"
abstract: >-
  A local-first marketing mix modeling workflow and frozen evidence-adaptive,
  set-wise research selector that learns from truth-blind posterior, evidence,
  validation, model-contract, and business-context tokens to reduce downstream
  economic decision regret.
keywords:
  - marketing mix modeling
  - Bayesian calibration
  - causal inference
  - posterior sampling
  - media optimization
  - decision-focused learning
  - economic regret
  - variational inference
